{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44545","headline":"诗三百三首 二四二 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二四二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人心猛利，一闻便知妙。\n中流心清净，审思云甚要。\n下士钝暗痴，顽皮最难裂。\n直待血淋头，始知自摧灭。\n看取开眼贼，闹市集人决。\n死屍弃如尘，此时向谁说。\n男儿大丈夫，一刀两段截。\n人面禽兽心，造作何时歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}